Third-party data (NOT covered by the licences above — each keeps its own terms)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/uci_occupancy.csv
  UCI Occupancy Detection dataset, UCI Machine Learning Repository, dataset 357.
  https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/357/occupancy+detection
  Candanedo, L. M., & Feldheim, V. (2016). Accurate occupancy detection of an
  office room from light, temperature, humidity and CO2 measurements using
  statistical learning models. Energy and Buildings, 112, 28-39.
  Licence: CC BY 4.0. Redistributed here merged from the three original files
  and sorted by timestamp (scripts/fetch_datasets.py reproduces it).

Open-Meteo (live feed, not bundled)
  Weather and air-quality data by Open-Meteo.com.
  https://open-meteo.com  —  Licence: CC BY 4.0.
  Air-quality values derive from the Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service
  (CAMS) global model via Open-Meteo.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Dependencies are installed from their upstream distributions and are not
redistributed in this repository; each is governed by its own licence.
  Core runtime (requirements.txt): FastAPI, Uvicorn, Pydantic, httpx,
    python-dotenv, python-multipart, Gymnasium.
  Imported directly but installed separately: NumPy (simulation, RL environment,
    calibration fit); Stable-Baselines3 with its PyTorch dependency (optional RL
    track, rl/ and the RLPolicy controller).
  Document tooling (scripts/update_docs.py, scripts/update_technical_report.py):
    python-pptx, python-docx.
  Firmware (hardware/firmware): the ESP32 Arduino core (Espressif), Adafruit DHT
    sensor library and Adafruit Unified Sensor, ArduinoJson.
